---
import { stats } from '../lib/catalog';
---

<figure class="kura">
  <div class="col">
    <h4>The catalog</h4>
    <p>One git repository you own.</p>
    <ul>
      <li>{stats.skills} skills as folders of Markdown</li>
      <li>{stats.agents} agents in {stats.bundles} bundles and <code>agents/</code></li>
      <li><code>skill-registry.json</code> pins every upstream source to a commit</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
  <div class="link" aria-hidden="true"><span></span></div>
  <div class="col engine">
    <h4>kura</h4>
    <p>Decides what each place should see, and links it there.</p>
    <ul>
      <li><code>sync</code> for what every repo gets</li>
      <li><code>add</code>, <code>scout</code> for one project</li>
      <li><code>doctor</code>, <code>restore</code> when links drift</li>
      <li><code>update</code> to pull upstream</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
  <div class="link" aria-hidden="true"><span></span></div>
  <div class="col views">
    <h4>Native views</h4>
    <p>Plain symlinks each harness already knows how to read.</p>
    <div class="view">
      <strong>Claude Code</strong>
      <code>.claude/skills/</code>
      <code>.claude/agents/</code>
    </div>
    <div class="view">
      <strong>Pi</strong>
      <code>.agents/skills/</code>
      <code>.pi/agents/</code>
    </div>
    <div class="view">
      <strong>Every repo on the machine</strong>
      <code>~/.claude/skills/</code>
      <code>~/.agents/skills/</code>
    </div>
  </div>
</figure>

<style>
  .kura {
    margin: 0;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) 2.5rem minmax(0, 1fr) 2.5rem minmax(0, 1.1fr);
    align-items: stretch;
  }

  .col {
    padding: 1.2rem 1.3rem;
    color: var(--sumi);
    background: var(--grout);
    border: 1px solid var(--rule);
    font-size: var(--step--1);
  }

  .col h4 {
    margin-bottom: 0.2rem;
  }

  .col p {
    color: var(--sumi-soft);
    margin-bottom: 0.8rem;
  }

  .col ul {
    margin: 0;
    padding-left: 1rem;
  }

  .col li + li {
    margin-top: 0.3rem;
  }

  .engine {
    background: var(--ai);
    color: var(--grout);
    border-color: var(--ai);
  }

  .engine h4 {
    font-size: var(--step-3);
    font-weight: 800;
  }

  .engine p {
    color: #dfe5ef;
  }

  .engine code {
    background: var(--ai-ink);
    color: #e2c47f;
  }

  .view {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.1rem;
    padding: 0.55rem 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);
  }

  .view code {
    justify-self: start;
  }

  .link {
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
  }

  .link span {
    width: 100%;
    height: 2px;
    background: #7f8c91;
    position: relative;
  }

  .link span::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    right: -1px;
    top: -4px;
    border: 5px solid transparent;
    border-left: 7px solid #7f8c91;
    border-right: none;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .kura {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .link {
      height: 2rem;
    }

    .link span {
      width: 2px;
      height: 100%;
    }

    .link span::after {
      right: -4px;
      top: auto;
      bottom: -1px;
      border: 5px solid transparent;
      border-top: 7px solid #7f8c91;
      border-bottom: none;
    }
  }
</style>
